<p>The <strong class="selflink">Backgrounds 2da</strong> defines the standard backgrounds and their availability to particular combinations of race and class.
</p><p>The <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/2DA" title="2da">2da</a> is not listed in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/M2DA%20base%202da" title="M2DA base 2da">M2DA_base 2da</a> but can be referenced in scripting using the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/TABLE" title="TABLE *">TABLE_RULES_BACKGROUNDS</a> constant defined in <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/2da%20constants%20h" title="2da constants h">2da_constants_h</a>.
</p>
