<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>The <b>DescStrref</b> column does not appear to be used (all values are 0) and to have been superseded by <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Background%20desc%202da" title="Background desc 2da">background_desc</a>.
</p><p>The <b>Skill_#</b> columns do not appear to be used (all values are **** (i.e. empty)).
</p>
